          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 132665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual método HTTP é usado para enviar dados para o servidor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>GET</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>POST</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sua coleção <code>/players</code> tem dez jogadores. Você envia um novo perfil para adicionar o décimo primeiro. Qual método é adequado?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>PUT</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>PATCH</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>POST</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "PUT Body - Copy",
            "id": 132677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um endpoint <code>PUT</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>put</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Registre <code>/users</code> para solicitações que substituem dados do usuário, em vez de ler, criar, atualizar parcialmente ou excluir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"patch\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>put</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #22",
            "id": 132686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual código de status HTTP é normalmente retornado quando uma solicitação <code>PATCH</code> atualiza com sucesso um recurso?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200 OK</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201 Created</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>200 OK</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma solicitação <code>PATCH</code> altera um usuário existente com sucesso. Qual status o servidor deve retornar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200 OK</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201 Created</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>204 No Content</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>404 Not Found</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>200 OK</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #23",
            "id": 132687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que o servidor deve retornar se o recurso a ser modificado não for encontrado?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404 Not Found</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400 Internal Server Error</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200 OK</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>404 Not Found</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma solicitação <code>PATCH</code> aponta para um usuário ausente. Outra aponta para um existente, mas omite o email obrigatório.</p><p>Quais códigos de status correspondem a essas falhas, nessa ordem?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code>, depois <code>400</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400</code>, depois <code>404</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>404</code>, depois <code>200</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code>, depois <code>400</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>404</code>, depois <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: PUT Body JSON - Copy",
            "id": 132679,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um endpoint <code>PUT</code> para atualizar um pet específico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/pet/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moo!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>app</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>put</code>, <code>/pet</code>, <code>/:id\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a rota que substitui o pet identificado por <code>/pet/:id</code> e registra <code>Moo!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/pet/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moo!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"patch\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/users/:id\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>app</code> seguido de <code>.</code>, <code>put</code>, <code>/pet</code> e finalmente <code>/:id\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: POST Body 2 - Copy",
            "id": 132690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Defina o código correto para indicar que a operação foi um sucesso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>204</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua a exclusão bem-sucedida com o status sem conteúdo e sem corpo de resposta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"delete\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"status\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"send\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>204</code> seguido de <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 132666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que o servidor deve fazer quando recebe a solicitação POST?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Salve os dados com os campos fornecidos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Atualizar um artigo existente com o mesmo nome</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Salve os dados com os campos fornecidos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Existem dois registros de jogadores. Você cria outro com <code>POST /players</code> e <code>username</code> igual a <code>DauT</code>.</p><p>Qual resultado corresponde a essa solicitação de criação?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Três registros, incluindo um novo com o username DauT.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dois registros, com um jogador substituído por DauT.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dois registros inalterados; a solicitação só retorna dados.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Três registros, incluindo um novo com o username DauT.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "PUT Body 2 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Envie uma mensagem de volta e defina o código de status correto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.patch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User updated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status(201)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User updated\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>res</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>status(200)</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Responda ao <code>PATCH /users/:id</code> bem-sucedido com o status <code>200</code> e o texto simples <code>User updated</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.patch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User updated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status(201)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User updated\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>res</code> seguido de <code>.</code>, <code>status(200)</code>, <code>.</code> e finalmente <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 132676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao criar um endpoint <code>PUT</code>, normalmente precisamos de um parâmetro de rota?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sim, para identificar o recurso</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não, o recurso a ser atualizado é determinado a partir do corpo da solicitação</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sim, para identificar o recurso.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma solicitação substitui o jogador em <code>/players/42</code>. Por que a rota <code>PUT</code> precisa de <code>:id</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele identifica o jogador a ser atualizado.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele armazena todos os campos substitutos na URL.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele transforma a solicitação em um <code>POST</code>.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ele cria automaticamente um novo jogador.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele identifica o jogador a ser atualizado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "POST Body - Copy",
            "id": 132668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um endpoint <code>POST</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>post</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "POST Body 2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acesse a propriedade <code>username</code> dos dados da solicitação.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"body\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>requestData</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e finalmente <code>username</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Leia o username enviado no corpo armazenado neste callback e registre-o.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"password\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res.body\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>requestData</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e finalmente <code>username</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
